# Wildfire Wickerfolk's delirium is checked continuously (CR 611.3a, 613): on turn 1 Wheel of Fortune puts Black Lotus (artifact), itself
# (sorcery) and an Island (land) into Bot1's graveyard - only three card types, so on turn 5 the Wickerfolk is its printed 3/2 with haste
# and no trample. Cast Violent Urge on itself (R, the spell resolves with the graveyard still at three types, so it gains first strike
# and +1/+0 only), the Urge reaches the graveyard as the fourth type (instant) and the Wickerfolk becomes 4/3 + 1 = 5/3 with trample as well.
# Attacking into Bot2's Ornithopter (0/2) it tramples 3 over, first strike or not: 20 - 3 = 17. Ownership counts: only Bot1's graveyard.

